WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.920
It's 1989 and we're here in Panama, where&nbsp;
the U.S. has control of a very important&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:09.780
canal. And luckily, the Panamanian dictator&nbsp;
has been very friendly to American interests.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:14.160
But the U.S. starts losing confidence in this&nbsp;
guy. Wondering if he's really the best choice,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:19.860
ensuring the U.S. maintain easy access to their&nbsp;
vital canal. Oh, and it didn't help that this guy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:25.260
was indicted in Florida on drug trafficking and&nbsp;
money laundering charges. We got to get him out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:29.460
But the straw that broke the camel's back for&nbsp;
this guy was when Panamanian troops killed an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:34.560
unarmed American soldier in Panama City. The U.S.&nbsp;
is done with this guy. So they invade Panama with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:40.500
27,000 troops. Panama’s military is crushed&nbsp;
and the dictator is eventually arrested and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:45.060
sentenced to 40 years in prison. And the&nbsp;
U.S. ensures access to its canal after all.

